{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07461","headline":"酬屈突陕 · 刘长卿","name":"酬屈突陕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落叶纷纷满四邻，萧条环堵绝风尘。\n乡看秋草归无路，家对寒江病且贫。\n藜杖懒迎征骑客，菊花能醉去官人。\n怜君计画谁知者，但见蓬蒿空没身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07461.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07461","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}